  "content": "<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/rULzJh3O/images/db5b7429f6aff5540d00b975fc194f15a81b3c73.png\" alt=\"标题\"></h2><h1>💍附加RPG珠宝</h1><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/loader-fabric-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"146\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadditional-rpg-jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fAShKd5XrTu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffichteee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/donations-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/ProfessorFichte/Additional-RPG-Jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a></p><hr><h2>📂 安装</h2><p><strong>🚨必备模组</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" rel=\"nofollow\">珠宝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-rpg-classes\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多RPG库</a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>👍强烈推荐的模组</strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fichteee/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的更多RPG职业模组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daedelus_dev/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">整个RPG系列项目</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>🕹️ 功能</h2><ul>\n<li>收集专为更多RPG职业系列创建的附加珠宝</li>\n<li>使用原版材料和珠宝模组中的宝石制作一些珠宝</li>\n<li>你可以在与钻石矿石相同的层级挖掘到这些宝石</li>\n<li>在地牢宝箱中找到这些珠宝</li>\n<li>通过装备珠宝获得属性加成</li>\n</ul><p><strong>配置</strong></p><ul>\n<li>珠宝加成：</li>\n<li>config/additional_rpg_jewelry/items.json</li>\n<li>战利品注入：</li>\n<li>config/rpg_series/loot.json</li>\n</ul><hr><p>&nbsp;</p>",
